sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant UI as Checkout UI
  participant Clerk
  participant Action as createCheckoutSession
  participant Sanity
  participant Stripe
  participant Hook as Stripe webhook
  participant Email as SMTP / email module
  Customer->>UI: Submit cart
  UI->>Action: Cart product IDs, quantities, options
  Action->>Clerk: auth() and currentUser()
  alt Not signed in or cart empty
    Action-->>UI: Return validation error
  else Signed in
    Action->>Sanity: Fetch products by IDs
    Sanity-->>Action: Current price, stock, colors, sizes
    Action->>Action: Validate quantities, options, stock
    alt Invalid cart
      Action-->>UI: Return item errors
    else Valid cart
      Action->>Stripe: Create Checkout Session using server prices
      Stripe-->>Action: Session URL
      Action-->>UI: Redirect URL
      UI->>Stripe: Customer completes hosted payment
      Stripe-->>UI: Return to success or checkout cancel URL
      Stripe->>Hook: checkout.session.completed / async_payment_succeeded
      Hook->>Hook: Verify stripe-signature
      alt Invalid signature
        Hook-->>Stripe: HTTP 400
      else Valid signature
        Hook->>Hook: Require paid session and payment intent
        Hook->>Sanity: Find order by stripePaymentId
        alt Existing order
          Sanity-->>Hook: Existing order
        else No existing order
          Hook->>Stripe: Fetch checkout session line items
          Stripe-->>Hook: Product metadata and amounts
          Hook->>Hook: Validate required metadata and phone
          Hook->>Sanity: Create order document
          Hook->>Sanity: Transactionally decrement product stock
        end
        Hook->>Sanity: Claim email delivery marker
        Hook->>Email: Send confirmation
        alt Email sent
          Email-->>Hook: Accepted, mark sent
          Hook-->>Stripe: HTTP 200
        else Processing or delivery failure
          Hook-->>Stripe: HTTP 500 for retryable processing error
        end
      end
      UI->>Action: Retrieve session for success display
      Action->>Clerk: Verify signed-in user
      Action->>Stripe: Retrieve session
      Action->>Action: Confirm session metadata belongs to user
      Action-->>UI: Return session details or access error
    end
  end
